%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 52895d688248030459544f95fb0e4e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: VoiceBank
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::VoiceBank
  lines:
  - speaker: Asa
    text: I can't go on... come back for me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b36487fd38043204799f3c41c1e04c39, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Asa
    text: There's good dirt under all this moss. Who's been using it?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd07c4203cea27f44b32ccbf7c102018, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Asa
    text: You're not from the village. Doesn't matter. Help me with this sack.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49803bdab1faf0841b79ab23ed61048b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Anything else?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 507a815e0116cf04ab4482113d562c2d, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Behind you!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 37e0089e38bbb0d45a9fe7ecbc672497, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Clear. Get your breath.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ce1a81d3341020c48ae55231b2a41c81, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Here they come!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2870a97bd5318348a225b94a12e3133, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Hold still. Drink this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74f606c22f9eb1c4eaf777eedc9cbd8a, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: I blazed the trees going in, a cut every twenty paces. Coming back, my marks were on the wrong side of them. The road hadn't moved. The roots had moved it, under us, in the night. Tor was thrown further in than me, with a bad leg. Listen for a saw where nobody saws.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab1cab7b83bcd0a41a7bb1e4fa4180d0, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: I came to examine the old iron markers. Whatever protects the road has cracked. Steel will help tonight, but steel alone will not mend this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c45e3357e242a1c429c125cd14f0c679, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: I can't take much more of this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54a0e1a9396c1634aa20f4a96271f742, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: I owe you one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4dc3e85ba2b9341499508f1b5e401c78, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: I'll hold this spot.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1fa9404d8e0c14438af55dcc74d5fd4, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: I'll keep back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb6ef4f8bac2f1143833bc28b2009a9d, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: I'm hurt!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e7cb44b10a9a974c8ac72deb135a1f9, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Not yet, you don't. Drink.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15c215313912bca4c951362c6238faed, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Nothing gets to you without going through me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21cfafc9ee9d06547814ba149e97d39c, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Point the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 057a405473ed17d41b8863919f15a1c6, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3774dc756c03e404399dd0d54b3e410a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Stay near the stones. We can still get out of this together.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe9551bf98219584e8864adaec855fc3, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Still here. Still here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1af42aec1d375e4cbbf5b722c79b05b, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Tell Sigrid I kept it lit.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72b8b7f0172fe8c409fa0010a50051a2, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Thank you. I thought that was it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 356b11b8d6359b244998af3a0a0d3280, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: That's the last of them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1126f72dbcbaa8445affca5861dfa01f, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Watch your back!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6416262af2fc1b74cbe07fa11007e8b9, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5e952e0afedcb141870e148403c4090, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Weapons up!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbfbc780e3602d74c92b9aa27711694a, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: Where's the anvil? No, don't tell me. I'll find it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57f221b3844013c458ae489612287e27, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: You took your time. Mind the hammer.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7866238e06ce11b48ab8cad7e274a72f, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Bjarne
    text: You're bleeding. Here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e61c23a8ecbf3d346912a1f14c609b3c, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: A bewitched forest. My grandmother called any forest that ate her goats bewitched.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5ba246834c9a2d45a02c2cc1e44a0e0, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: A soldier's choice. It is old iron, but it holds an edge. Guard well and let them come to you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6dffd0a0a3838394e9db576dc7d5462b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: A whole day gone in a morning's walk. I don't like this, and I have liked very few things.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff7af6077b097034f80df9426df95ba6, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: And the kindling you cut this morning is dry in your pack. We only need stones.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2cab46183d862324692d0f89a8d5864f, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: And there is only dry bread, unless someone fancies a walk. Ask me if you do.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a7b79be8218a5874da4dbb0dfe4ea395, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Anything else?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 83068c97dd16e3d4596ae04ab143dd09, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Before we set out? Gladly. Take this practice sword; it bruises, it doesn't cut. Hit the dummy by the fire until your arm knows the way, then come and try it on me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9471952cc6628934f989972b3f7f72dc, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Behind you!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a283a64be3ad8741aa56f4a866a9df1, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Behind you, you fool!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed89d1a92d186694bafde644d4d42689, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Breakfast! You may be the best person on this expedition. Keep the rod; there is bound to be water in those woods.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ba930f3e4c17014f94a5b4507f64569, type: 3}
    mood: Joyful
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Clean your blade. It's a bad habit to forget.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93846f07e7c1b1547bfd3778c6cb369f, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Clear. Get your breath.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52f025ddcf6b1a547b9bcfafe980ea13, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Come back when it's done.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f08111001f8daf045988347326a0b533, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Don't look at me like that. I was resting. ...Thank you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 51357d1b788232e4aa5da24909d7e648, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Down you go. Catch your breath; we go again when you're ready.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f87de12687ce902489ff2fdd762733f5, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Dry bread, unless you fancy a walk. There are berry bushes in the clearing west of the shelter. Pick five and stew them over the fire; take my waterskin for the pot. Be quick about it. I do not like how quiet it is.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ad0baedc0049e6049b51e6f4622a7821, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: 'Dummy first, then me. Watch my shoulders: the blow is coming when they drop.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12ead151de096d344b5426345228c780, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Eat something, even if you are not hungry. I have buried enough friends who thought they could fight on an empty stomach.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 28bcab84dccf87f43a346b795b8f2d88, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Eat something. It is a long road, and the porridge is not getting any better.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c466766e5c6c62b4ea8f04f22b6fb9a6, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Eirik. Twenty winters in the shield wall at Granheim. I walk in front, I carry the heavy things and I make sure everyone eats. There is porridge. It is bad.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2feeaf8c0fe6ce548945ccd2188575b6, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Enough, enough! I yield. You'll do.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee4a459efdcd8fb449b1bccc7c9370e0, type: 3}
    mood: Joyful
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Finally, something I can hit.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 327646bbfc4722a4c99ec49f29daec04, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Five berries from the clearing to the west, then the pot. My waterskin is in your pack.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e76a88054f797654aaca70589f4a1b68, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Go! I will hold them. Nobody gets left behind, not while I am standing.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 28856ba356339414ca776b8462ce4d59, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Go. I've held worse.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 327a4ac5c76c2c941a7b2d69b6aed799, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Good. Now me. When I wind up, raise your guard just before the blow, or roll through it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: adb50d458299a2c40885e12c709c994b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Here they come!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e72afac7acd476408181fe711df7a33, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Hold still. Drink this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3067dbb560caa1479ec8f1854db609e, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Hot food. You have just made three friends for life. Take these, in case the night is not done with us.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 58c0be05072d59d41ba0530435096d1e, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: I can't take much more of this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e507a31f27313994f91fef5a8713899b, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: I owe you one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5677fc41c7a8634a8d0fd8b0d29af21, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: I salted what was left of your fish, so we need fewer berries. Two handfuls will do.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e20fd68a506a604788a3d5f686e8bb4, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: I trust that she wants to get out of here alive. That is enough for tonight. But watch her hands when she talks about the stones. She knows more than she says.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d9f1bf9af8b9a749b2b79f361add32a, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: I'll hold this spot.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46a75a232524a2a4184e0e98383185e3, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: I'll keep back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3bd6651b503aa80459d9b0719d940ae5, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: I'm hurt!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab969f96233cac349a4ad8c5a69eeef2, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Is it past noon already? We have not been walking an hour.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 301ba9746bb278c4ba3472acbd8c08e8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Is that all? I was only warming up.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a48c480d00063d4ba6377100b63934a, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: It is this place. At the tree line I had to think for my own sister's name. I did not like to say.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74b7a60713ceb95408be796aca66d42d, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Long reach, and it wants both hands. If you ever need a light instead, press L to swap them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66f291ca0d56c844581fafbd4c919ccb, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: My knees are too old to run from a closing portal. Next time leave earlier.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80509fd8ca841a84197e89bda19f0439, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: My sister's farm is two valleys from here. Her dogs ran into these woods last month and never came back. Someone has to walk in front. Better me than you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5d5a9dce9fa60754eb3dd8fd0b0eae84, type: 3}
    mood: Sad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Not yet, you don't. Drink.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89b0dc09e4bf8a4468444967cab918c6, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Nothing gets to you without going through me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 661fa7550239f414481d760c1e597ddd, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Nothing gets worse than this porridge.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cfb4050fd2624654fae3ff5fefda58f8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Now that is a fine idea. Anything but this porridge. Here is a rod and a handful of grubs, and the lake is just south of the road. Two fish, and I'll owe you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d8cbe106cda7ea40a924402a6385377, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Once, as a boy, with my sister. Spruce, moss, the quiet you get in old woods. Nothing in it frightened me but the dark. I would like that to still be true.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8ed445dac0096754ab228e14c211005d, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Point the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec4064322b7c9774ba3f3e61401c64b8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6fc4282fac76bf9438d0066f474da8de, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Show me the wall. Then show me where it's weakest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0376781091242514e8954362c0db1410, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Sigrid. The sun is going down. It was morning.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3282fc066ab7844438b3717a37a97b23, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Six logs from the slope north of the road. Walk up to a tree and get chopping.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ee96e8ac3b389f458ccbedc9f0e6f8d, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Stay behind my shield, if you can find it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f249cb30e3329224f886ed3a1cdb7173, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Stay between me and the trees. If anything comes out of the dark, it meets my shield first.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47e09c1fa05388b4fad74e0484e6d64e, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Steady now. It is a fine morning to walk into something stupid.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 398353fdd173e4040a12a1a2a51f6fce, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Still got one more swing in me, then.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd36014e6e651d746bfc3e86500bbe23, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Still here. Still here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ccf246ac4de2c3640923316412e9a980, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Thank you. I thought that was it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 41b20d24cd2df7d4ca9fefa34c84c929, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: That many, and I'm still here. Don't tell the young ones. They'll want to try it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 817143be8a6789044885cf35795c695e, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: That trout this morning. I keep thinking about that trout.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: abe009523260d864a9741a3578b14e6a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: That will keep us warm. Keep the hatchet.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 87f36997daa8bf54b965b188c2a9796a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: That's the last of them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2bdef70829612f142801275529e6f5d5, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: The axe. Good. It splits wolves and firewood alike, and it leaves you a hand free.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d850ccf58df47ea4ba56d5923d694aee, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Then we are after the same thing. We will find them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac5d57419608a93499757c2b0e6871f5, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Took you long enough. How many are behind you?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e153e03342f07cd4090b72a6946d8548, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Twenty winters in the shield wall at Granheim. I stopped counting the fights a long time ago. I still count the friends.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d392507aa452f3d4b9a8f1ae7a65bb7f, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Twenty winters I've been telling that kind of story. First time it's been true.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1f9b6f86db5f4ac4fa462c9ae9e03c25, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Twenty winters, and it still hurts.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e264abed5f998474b9435ec6ba205afe, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Twenty years a soldier, and I have never seen the sun simply leave.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a51688df118cafc46acc43a0c957636c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Two fish from the lake. Hold attack to swing back, let go to cast, and strike when the float goes under.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 198dc949c4911b9468bd601db8fd7279, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Ugh. Took your time.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8ba33006eb335fb4eb61432fca85a857, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Watch your back!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13bb415a67faf2342a974ba12f277809, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: We always need firewood. Take this hatchet; there are good trees on the slope north of the road. Six logs will do us.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7f0d7df89bd9e7941b3a0bafa25b5d2a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Weapons up!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 098243ef290253c4689750d88a518e7a, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: 'Whoever you came for: we have not stopped looking. Remember that.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb11234114a05e34292295d300f5de9f, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: Wolves, probably. Perhaps a witch, perhaps a sick troll. It is usually less than the stories and more than you packed for. Four friends, if we are lucky. Bjarne owes me money.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10682ec7f7b547343843c8215e6c45ce, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: You'll do. Better than most I have trained, worse than you will be. Take these; you will want them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1f2b17393d3eeca43bb6a394d46d3fb6, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Eirik
    text: You're bleeding. Here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91a8b2ae30b0dad448e9cc509eb967fe, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Gunnar
    text: I can't go on... come back for me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d8a052ab15627442a6e8befcbc72820, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Gunnar
    text: Took you long enough. That boar's been lying on me since yesterday.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dbee761b1a9125c4e93df02ea5f8c88f, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Gunnar
    text: You've been frightening my deer. Least you can do is give me a roof.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08b1c97dfc4a0df4884bf817884c33bd, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Hild
    text: I can't go on... come back for me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d7d9b3b8034dfe7459ae23323ba494d4, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Hild
    text: Mind the coping. It's the only level thing for a mile.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 83e1a7262aedf7f4d8e97a60213b6846, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Hild
    text: Whoever laid this hearth had never met a level. I'll stay.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d2e0777309fdde4dbb1a9b0219694d0, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Anything else?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 771b8c90681689a459d9b8bc289d2489, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Behind you!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: baffb943bef550c458235f11ef47355f, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Clear. Get your breath.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4bd5ece68cfd5084f92278d69c02afa0, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Here they come!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10dfeec2e307694419f0aa9f5a00db15, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Hold still. Drink this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de695576f93f22d47a0a43f4a814572e, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: I can't take much more of this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 53a1127e45503f04e902382209d7bf35, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: I can't... go on. I'll hide here. Come back for me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a13d7ac408ac32439f9b6b0de42314e, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: I kept saying the word so the forest couldn't take it. Fire. Fire. Fire. And then I saw yours.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38b9b429b4819ab48800cba96fabd247, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: I owe you one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 651174f167d171a4fb58a8c082218afd, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: 'I watched your fire for three nights from under a root. You should know two things. The old troll at the stones didn''t come for us: it came for the door. And on the second night something walked past my root in Granheim mail, like Eirik''s. I called to it. It turned, and it didn''t know its name. When the stones broke I heard Bjarne''s hammer start up, somewhere deep in the woods, slow, like he''s working one-handed. Let me be of use until we find them.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a34168d08bced6947a42e7b291497dbb, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: I'll hold this spot.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 814b624a65521a24897ddbdc325aa962, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: I'll keep back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ce96d222bd9d59547a44271fdaa2e093, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: I'm hurt!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae85375c5d1463e419c0db98a8ff72f0, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: It's you! I saw a light through the trees and thought the forest had finally taken my wits. Get me out of here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 171236ce7c4a21f4098e784cc7857a0b, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Not yet, you don't. Drink.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bcdec0d6d08e53944914e6f052e5648c, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Nothing gets to you without going through me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b389054f4422b8a4493d8900d2619018, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Point the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 58417356612a74d45966f0b9800b8bb7, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f199ca9f1a8f1a4bbacd90a5284f553, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Stay near the stones. We can still get out of this together.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc76f2affc3a2f0489f684b6aae6c9ba, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Still here. Still here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 406107643a52cb34290f8deb49727acf, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Thank you. I thought that was it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 210b2dc587df6c34c91a29a7698013af, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: That's the last of them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b4a6341e4ba9e948891dd65e8f60561, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: The plants are wrong. Roots that should sleep in this season are warm to the touch. Something is feeding the enchantment. Stay close; I brought a little medicine.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3207f5acc12276649a29fd77f9eedcd4, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Watch your back!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 514e4958ecc9605479397dbf3fbd95a4, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7694001cb777cc84489ab113aa5edb3b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: Weapons up!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7aefb445ea1fd0b43b76b699d90a9315, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Ingrid
    text: You're bleeding. Here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a15ba7712d48bb4fb9dbe009f268e75, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Anything else?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e82013321a21cf9458c7d818848761c2, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Behind you!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c4d2f37ff5a7b04fb44a0cdc81de64e, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Clear. Get your breath.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89dc2c86b836c494d8ff5d71bb8e5b50, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Here they come!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48f6a81b82906004fb457969902956dd, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Hold still. Drink this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a57e42cc47a00a144b440da5c82d7c98, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Liv
    text: I can't take much more of this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4dd5503233e6da740a4d536b486d88ca, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Liv
    text: I owe you one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc194ac9fe30f6b4ea37f3348c722d91, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Liv
    text: I'll hold this spot.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 71e74c2b3a7c2714db60d58485d63a62, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: I'll keep back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f169c828cc4d0b449930c967a7d76477, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: I'm hurt!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6359e7e3627139e439732878eb9476a3, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Not yet, you don't. Drink.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef9b064ff837c1447aa5133b20684ac1, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Nothing gets to you without going through me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0805304cd77a8504caa22a68b3412cfd, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Point the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a9549ed3555c6f4b8357e61be3dc18b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e843bd4ab599c214c924f4d34ca23ea9, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Still here. Still here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd2e0d39dee6ba243b48c85837583dbd, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Thank you. I thought that was it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 04d50f3f5ebdbd649956560f7cc48af0, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Liv
    text: That's the last of them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03ca90bf20884244eb3764c311d9dfea, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Liv
    text: The stones are answering you. Stay close. I will try to keep the passage open.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3416589ad3fc3864ba2ea6b1c2425e6c, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Liv
    text: The stones broke along a line. A line! Do you understand what that means?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a32e007b442c17d45a2d5a45afb793e9, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: There are old paths here, older than the villages. My teacher said the waystones connected places of shelter. I thought that was only a story.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c249dbfbad7d7d84088f454b1051e76b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Watch your back!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3d03cfa41a50c748a6ce23ccb8415b4, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Liv
    text: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3be901309a511b84baf60103dd3e69fc, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Weapons up!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b784bf39ab41504aafc472cd407ac88, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Write it down. Somebody has to write it down.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66a92fd1d9a7c434ea7f135dc386a021, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Liv
    text: Your ward is a promise too. Did anyone tell you?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68a2ea839bb590d46ba8ad6e16546756, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Liv
    text: You're bleeding. Here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2811366d1e044d44aa5cf44521b6c5e2, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Runa
    text: 'A bow! Then there are two of us. Hold the left button to draw, let go to shoot. It wants both hands: if you ever need a light instead, press L to swap them.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e10a06dcf9691e348ad0d7a0d4993041, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: A shepherd told me his dogs won't go past the tree line any more. Dogs. I have seen those dogs go after a bear.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 60e60de069e0c6346bbfddd1147488ef, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: All clear.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 246fc323bc90a6648a3cf8f44f556923, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: An honest answer. I like you already.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 65b1c68954e2f8843a335d5ca1307aa1, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Anything else?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e42d85a37bb25144afd9728e84015d6, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: 'As it happens. There is a boar out on the grass north of the road, east of the camp, which is wrong all by itself, and we could use the meat. Take my spare bow: hold the left button to draw, let go to shoot. Bring it down.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a64060f13f71ac9448ca60b05258baf2, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Behind you! Turn around!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c0f1febe953baf48909b5c49fefef58, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Behind you! Turn!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2df6c1fcd101c51459125db621f9b3c1, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Boar, running flat out, and not from us. Off the road!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f8fe6ce5afe5724288d71004def958e, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Bow's still good. So am I.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74239cae808b4374da6e7d7df070f7e5, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Clean enough. Keep the bow; you've earned it, and I was tired of carrying it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 874361cc0a48fcd4ab5f75b71d5a4f93, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Come back when it's done.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a76dc37174204e540ae9740778c41314, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Contact! I've got the range.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f004f8f4442d8b4eab921f500cc4df8, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Deer, boar, wolf, all running west out of the trees, out here where they don't belong. Nothing sleeps in the open unless it is afraid to sleep at home.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1dbc98fd453f16442bb82f5b9ca4d1c1, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Down! Moss trolls in the bushes, the small kind. Don't let them get behind you!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b7587afb06bc4b41809d6dd35d796dc, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Hold still. Drink this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d234d2413caa9c428b3f9e590a4ea95, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Hold up. That's Bjarne's handcart, tipped off the road. Have a look; I'll watch the trees.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab97c743e16e6bb41a3d349d5de0da2b, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I counted our steps to the exit. I'd rather not count that close again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 290a9c897b0fd244a9c0174ed2e3c57e, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I counted three wolves circling and one shape that was not a wolf. Keep your voice down. I would rather see them before they see us.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77d6d43e94a1cb245b906345bb40bfbb, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I know the way. Go on. I'll catch you up.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a968875f42be7eb48a9884b8dd544c56, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I owe you one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc6f5c651d353c945be79d86bfce67b4, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I see them. Take the near ones.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49013079f05fb8740a8339b6ea0b49cb, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I will take the ones on the stones. You just keep breathing.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b2f79279eededc4fbe22c37f3feff77, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I'll hold this spot.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a77b4da4bb8142548bdae09c11a78782, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I'll keep back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b6219b91f3dd6834b9cc14f9e9a6f54c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I'm bleeding!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e27cef95161e3a4469daecebade2eb76, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Runa
    text: It followed us! The old one, coming through the trees, right for the stones!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bcf03c80a87f2643b1935558f653b7a, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Runa
    text: It hasn't seen us yet. It will smell the smoke soon enough.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb1fc1c06f619d54cbf32932d86d3ed7, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I've tracked things my whole life, and never one that big. It left nothing behind but quiet. I don't trust the quiet.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc2e0dd987cd6ce4f97da6fb6ad18f88, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: I've watched you for two days. You leave a trail like a cart.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b664268b5889ed44a87c7bb509197348, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Liv.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6339812b4f2b77d4eaeac365a85a3a24, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Runa
    text: More of them, coming round the other side!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3db403b6baa161f4ea54f61f32220c28, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Move. I've got your back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5d9469d380b8b794abf5b734fe89f26c, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Moving, there!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e20a69933f201ae4dbd03401f8fea2e7, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Nice morning. That is usually how it starts.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 741de59b199ca0740be59f9bc3d897ab, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: No birds. Have you noticed? Not one for a while now.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3c5437041e089c459dae8707591f30c, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Not yet, you don't. Drink.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9984e679fa00f0459af6286497b9d62, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Nothing else moving.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f917846b8ab9f524e893f3632213c60a, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Nothing else on the wind.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7dff68e6cdf422c47ae30ef66534189a, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Nothing gets to you without going through me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ceaea7418ce33d4d9088d269a8d8ac9, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Off the road, on your left! Rootlings. They were lying in wait, and they don't do that.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd7bcb06eaf054f4587aef86952619dd, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: On your back!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2490ec969c97feb4291e2c12619c9ab2, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Poaching on the jarl's land. You learn to hit with the first arrow when the second one brings the wardens.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e41326343ac0bf04e953bb8de54f325a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Point the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0dd3cc9aefce2574dbbc94d206ecfacc, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 50ee2cf2f1e15aa4baf9bbb76952511e, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Runa. I find the tracks, and I shoot what makes them. Trolls off their crags, witches on the roads, wolves that don't run from fire. I want to see it for myself before I believe any of it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b630fe8dddfdc849b1eaf980afa89bc, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Sigrid. Look behind us. Where is the road? It was right there, and now there's only mist.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 663cd1a73989465429534e500fd844e9, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Simple. I respect that. Hit it until it stops, and it leaves you a hand free.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd38d185d18123d49b31a63d80b62b98, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Small ones never come alone and never come this far down. Something up in the high woods is scaring them. Finish the berries and get back to the fire.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c73a4b0c2e80f614a9df9011fc95a75d, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Someone is paying. And I would rather know what is coming out of there than wait for it to find me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 32cbbb580447d574797cb1329bd0c2a1, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Still here. Still here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 45d7491edd5c6144dba729195089836c, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Still think the coin is worth it?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8b08f907523c8342ba2a8eeed2f6732, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Thank you. I thought that was it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ea73de70d4ed4b4dbef50bcab7d66a0, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: That's all of them. I think.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 087f9d3db4e570049b9a94dd4bae4adb, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Runa
    text: The boar, on the grass north of the road, east of the camp. Hold the left button to draw.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 55330e0598b41784ba3b6782f12ac214, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: The forest doesn't hate us. It doesn't notice us. That's worse. Next time I pick the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 63833d0fe975b874bbe39f3852ff5d29, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: The shadows are wrong. They were behind us when we crossed the stream.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c687087c94df444f89c669e99f40b99, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: There! In the trees!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e796fc2dcd1add5438cd20312ffc0cb4, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: There. Feel that? The wind turned, and there is mist coming up off the moss.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 246dea1a952668f488500a5b1a369292, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: They're too close, I need room!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 81ea3fc73cda9a34db3e6f75d2e0c9ce, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Runa
    text: This place can be found. Good. So can everything else, by the same road.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ebbc495be3b3b04885d0088d293f798, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Too close, too close!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a6713e478ab65a41a13db717f036cca, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Tracks everywhere, all running the same way. Whatever they are fleeing, we are walking towards it. Lovely.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d03f894e2c385c74a88ef62f1305099b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Troll tracks. Small ones, the moss kind. They never come this far down. Something is pushing everything out of the high woods, and it is big.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 884998b47e09f6f42aa1238c2ab52ed9, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Walk where the moss is thick; it's quieter. Keep your back to the fire, never your face. And if you hear something heavy breathing, don't run until I say so.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 471231dede619f14cae77093e5d13a89, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Wolves behind them! In the open, in daylight. They don't do that. Weapons!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89ff60b0b72a9b74aa849a9c9645c4c4, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Wolves! They are not hunting; something is driving them towards us. Protect the camp!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 975467f132dd26c43af41894f85f276b, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Runa
    text: You crossed open ground to reach me. Stupid. Don't stop.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0303a7826858702498e9cf558bbf5d14, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Runa
    text: You shot straight this morning. It may matter before the night is out.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27e1f4c9d6643ad47801d4ae50c36024, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: Your grandmother never saw wolves walk into a lit camp.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ea329d713bc0364391d7b8cab265569, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Runa
    text: You're bleeding. Here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c068e26ed9424b04ab04698f2ab98d4b, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: <i>...can anyone hear... Ingrid was right behind me when the stones broke. She's hurt. Find her first. Do you hear me? Find her first...</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52b54995e4e17964cb4cbd276d46d84f, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: A fire. Sit down, all of you, and get your breath back. Whatever is out there will still be there when we are done.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 800f23c744e3c9e45ac0def39d2abc50, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: A retreat is only a defeat if you learn nothing. What did we learn?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66cd06d0129da4d4ca402df5d59edfd2, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Almost! Hold it off, just a little longer!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec5023652098a384da5f898cf713d78c, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: And you. You came to us with a strong back and few questions. Nobody walks towards that forest by accident. Why are you here?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a56913d0906859498894cd014f8b722, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Anything else?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c20f3a24c2a15de4abc172f1c5f892b5, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: At first light we find the four who went ahead. Ingrid. Bjarne. Tor. And...
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6bb2942bcbbb86944a4a1f109a2229fc, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Back in line. Thank you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69849ef4070d5334e99e75229b1e3b20, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Because the only old things out there are stones and roots, and the marks on them are older than any village. Whatever is wrong, I expect to find it written down.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bc0672dadd9f6004381da668e007d479, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Behind you!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8ab0f647cca8c64c927f8364427b944, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Behind you! Move!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 495dfdf4f712f554a935f6559cc1151f, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Careful. The ones who go looking for the truth of it are the ones who find it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d3280af03114123499693762dde7da10, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Clear. Get your breath.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a377c6b1b5fed474ab0cef6f14619373, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Come back when it's done.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a191135623010ec49b319db85d6527e7, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Count heads. Everyone still here?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f0c90a22c21b621489315ece92733262, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Don't you stop for me. That's an order.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f08432fac0d2bd04bbee093a9ab05ac2, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: 'Dry stone overhead. Good work. Now a fire, before anyone can think clearly: eight sticks and twelve small rocks off the forest floor, then build it beside the shelter (G).'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ccd248fd8a2be19479a6a510320b4aa3, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Eirik sees a great deal for a man who pretends not to. Yes. I have seen stones like these before, and I know what they do. Ask me again when you have to touch one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 33ee6ec3623381f40996336a491726b8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Finish your porridge and listen. This is the only quiet you will get today.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 51a1659c8a3ad324bb70f2649d1e775e, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: 'For anyone who slept through last night''s talk, and I know who you are: I am Sigrid, and we walk east today. The villages asked what is wrong in that forest. Two days ago I sent Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv ahead to look. They should have been back yesterday.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5e68a7b3f007004cafc5821d62cc65d, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Form up on me!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30caa25582557ba47b7696088724df70, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Good. Move before more come.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 625b7f02d0d135242a9ed7da39b2d31d, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Good. On your feet. I mean, on mine.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1dab3ce050c9744bb9574acb41d4f3d, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Here they come!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fdc346c5bfb3cda4fadf2f77aec5f7b6, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Hold still. Drink this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c670ab93bb3fba14da9ee377428819c6, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Hold together! Nobody gets left behind. We will find each other, whatever happens.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cef83a33b0472484098b0aed21cadc16, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I can see that. Light your torches, and take this one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 035b81e87a1636046bbc8fb5f78ca244, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I can't take much more of this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c2a664d43eeca6439da4c8bd6a4e82f, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I gave you an order once to leave me if it came to that. You didn't. We'll talk about discipline. Later.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e6e9566636aa2c44f87f7c6f75ab96df, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: 'I know what it feels like: a door left open in winter. Someone opened it on purpose. Whether they meant to let something in or out... that is what we came to find.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6e3fbb4f851e73541a8a181c4d07252a, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I owe you one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e1ed342704678d4e8436a7f79f3354d, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I'll hold this spot.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bc943b456a217c14aaa8ac1e05d79787, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I'll keep back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 718c37e203015dd4cb7acb8859aba786, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I'm hurt!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca1f21a0b4980da408e3cc4f7b7d158e, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: 'Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv. An alchemist, a smith, a carpenter and a scholar: the ones who can make sense of what they find. I sent them on two days ago to look over the old road. It was a short job.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57080f5b8a62a7e42ac1d890c1884535, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: It will not wake for me. It never has. You, then. Put your hand on the centre stone.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 60416b4c1a39d2a4fb65d21e98ca0edf, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I've buried good people on less than what we just did. Write it down somewhere. It should outlast us.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1800277adea1cae45ad248cec69b96ce, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: I've served under worse than you. Don't let it go to your head.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b0552f9fb2e4ac14c97324aca61d727b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Keep the torch high and the road under your feet. The forest is listening tonight. Let it hear only footsteps.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49533c4cb00330b42bd2bd76b40b87d8, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Keep walking.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3dc5a3d73b35f2847b637fee5dfc6ad5, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Leave the fire! Take the old path north, to the standing stones. Now!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9ac34d36ce337a44192fe056c06e10c8, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Liv. Of course. Eleven years I have known her, and for a moment there was a hole where her name should be.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b329fbfacb1b3d74ca233e4725c08510, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Not alone, and not before we are ready. Come back to the others.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bcedd102dc0412f40aace935112a2de8, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Not yet, you don't. Drink.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aeb1e9f4c690dcc48b9ae146f8625d11, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Nothing gets to you without going through me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: befbc45c61f1957429780542de382780, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Point the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 35b658344761fed429e8aae4b0abd336, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e45d12056145fe140b1c0c36ecd26c50, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Roots do not set ambushes on a road. Something taught them to. Keep moving. We need walls around us before more of them wake.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d9e0c8e97e06604fb0f60d8523377eb, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Rumours grow in the telling. That is why we go and look, instead of sitting in a longhouse and listening.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0802c3f9b4df5604da3a97747511d82e, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Save it for the road. We have until the porridge gets worse.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3a68437ee51c341479fe349780da323a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Seven went in. Tell me who's home.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1d82be22710edc41aafea6259ac293f, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Stand inside the ring. Whatever you see, do not let go of the stone until I say.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1325970dcedc844c8ce46d3193798b9, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Stand together! Nobody runs!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 44330b07a14869a448b5a6413c79e873, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Stay on the road. We keep a steady pace, and the others will wait if you fall behind.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4249691968b1d2b46bab9f587cc0992b, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Still here. Still here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b2ab11a20f672540afe4b31d50e39c8, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Still standing. Barely.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0fa4667c4151f9e4d86ce4ced6dcb617, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Take what time you need, but not too much. It is a long walk, and I want to be at the forest by noon.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4531729940bf6a148ae3b338d8cf8c6c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Thank you. I thought that was it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d49f80677ac92444a2bc2ae70a42b7f, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: That is no thunder. An old one, a mountain troll, and it is walking towards our fire.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93909d6548077e04caa339e543c101d2, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: That was no weather. The sun went down hours early and this storm came out of a clear sky. Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv walked into this two days ago, so we go on, not back. Follow the old road into the trees and find us dry shelter. We are right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3a20971acbec3d40bf74ff7e84037e5, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: That's the last of them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd1568d2e195b6942b3079df404926a6, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: The cause. Trolls do not leave their crags for no reason, and wolves do not forget fire. Something in that forest has changed, and the villages want it named before it reaches their doors.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fab4957a227a3fb43b87d46392a3b804, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: 'The packs are tied and the fire is nearly out. Ingrid''s party should have been back yesterday, and the forest is half a morning down the road. If you have anything left to do here, do it now: once we set out, we do not come back for it. Are you ready?'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4382ffa15e73194384e39cf1f4d5914, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: The road east is clear as far as the cart. Keep your eyes on the tree line, and stay close to the fire tonight.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c1fdf2d0ad833ef4abc598319d84389f, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: The rock shelter is along the old road, not far in. Go on, we are right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 357c6378f4b9b0841a22b06f60ab7df7, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: The stones are drawing power! Hold them off until the connection forms!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8066c856d41f13d43a1dcb7fa53f0812, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: The villages think we came for wolves and witches. Let them. The stones out here are older than any village, and someone has been waking them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 016f7e2907db03c4db290e6c39b085cf, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: The woods have names again. That is a start.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 875b8aabeb2c1d44e9496d05a75aeb14, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Then one thing first. Nobody walks that road unarmed. We carry spare arms in the packs. They are old and they are plain, but they will do. Take what suits you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 35df69812ada50646b5e08461daedb17, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: There you are. Come and stand by the fire with the rest of us. You should know who you are walking with before we set out.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c24604edeb859ac4abf9202c2e7c9c07, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: They did not send me. They asked for someone who could read the old marks, and I was the only one who answered. Draw your own conclusions. Everyone else does.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a2505b29dde59044bb6519b7c423e5f7, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Watch your back!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a1827ac7cc299345a8a61fd9de8506d, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: We leave when you are ready. If you want to earn your porridge first, ask the others. They always have something.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1788a4952f01a484a8f5f458185166d7, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: We set out at first light. Before that, is there anything you want to know about where we are going?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9652ee60019e4b440b890ed55ee548d3, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Weapons up!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3df35c1def9bbfb4b82acebc9ecb69d8, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Whatever you see, do not let go of the stone. There are things I should have told you, and there is no time left to tell them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d81e69ef466350843bc536bdda250a58, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Wolves that hunt by day and do not fear four armed people. Whatever happened to this cart was quick, and it did not end here. We go on.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c08e31b1694ddd44bb5fa66873ca8b8, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: Words for things your tongue has no names for. Most of them mean wait. One of them means open. Pray we only need the first kind.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b664d6830b38404084fe2437c1a7332, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: You asked me by the fire, so here it is. I have seen stones like these wake once. It took everyone who stood too near, and it put them somewhere else. Ingrid knew that when she came. Now you do.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f72940ec36efc24d8a3335b4d2226bf, type: 3}
    mood: Calm
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: You came back. I told them you would.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10cf312e2a69da843841dbfa2e0cee74, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: You wanted to know if the stories were true. How are you finding it?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4cd1aae57f8ef9147b9fdb02546a9ad1, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: You're bleeding. Here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4457d8f362d59914390905af27a78f06, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Sigrid
    text: You're up. Good. The fire needs wood, and the stones need waking. Sit with me a while first.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e062e4fa754e23040817c4d44eb2516c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>A fire first, little one. Fallen branches and loose stones lie all around me: pick them up, open the build menu (G) and light it inside my ward. The sooner it burns, the sooner they can see it.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a2b574d661a62a44f9bea6d4d4460fad, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>A fire first. Then a home worth coming back to. Then we go and fetch them. And one day, little one, you will tell me why these old stones woke for your hand.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cca676c07eff5dc49a15f06adc57887e, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>A held land asks something of you now and then, and its stone will tell you what. A Pact Rune laid in the stone holds it better still.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d8d86e62013b4254f80ef6f732b6f0bd, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>A horn at dusk, the expedition's signal. She is the last of them. Bring her home, little one.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21e15a690a561354e8b4963a043bd75e, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>A hundred winters I kept this clearing alone. I had forgotten how loud a home is. Do not stop.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bab4b77253f1c4945a68aedb5c8bc20d, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>A lit stone said: this much of the forest remembers a hearth. Inside that ring nobody lost the way home, and nobody lost their name.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4df7005e8a30c0e48b4df753fc87a601, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>A saw, out where nobody saws. Your carpenter is hurt, but he is still measuring.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 28860f3391c68914082d49a4ff1be6cc, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>A snare line, a mile of it, and at the end a man who did not mean to be caught.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85f9ddfa3dcc5c243a394677c0750660, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>A wall went up overnight out there, round nothing. Whoever built it will want to build a better one here.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6e2ca1faa93ad6d4b861fbbe9627f104, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>And the guardian under the roots, who kept the forest's half. Where is it now?</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee453819a19976a4694774c6c50a1c97, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>And this. Their door, and the night kept from it, for as long as the fire burned.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 95776a46879c4f74ea3405b97c68b607, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>Bare hands bring little home, little one. A hatchet in your belt and a pick beside it bring wood and ore. Sticks and sharp stones: make them in your bag (B).</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2740700c16cdd924ca535772bad8580a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Come and sit by me, little one. There is something I should have told you before you went to that hollow.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24ca25d4fdee33145bf03360ebddb3c3, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Did you see what grew out of them as they fell? Root. The same root that choked my stones, and closed the road behind your people.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d602fe8f0331c8143baf195c965f6738, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Do you feel that? The ward has remembered what it is for. And far out in the mist, little one, someone has stopped walking and turned to look.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd3edd3b7a6b7844d8be72fba32725d0, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Every hearth in my light is a little more of the old pact kept.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e8f71124c610a8a4e92f5554ea88ac6b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Every land you hold is a road home for whoever is still out there, and a door shut on what comes at night. Begin with the nearest stone.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1a004ee0ee6414c418648b7edf1823f7, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Find a place that a stone remembers, then lay your hand on the stone. The nearest stands not far past the meadows.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b1f2d13369b6984d83eb2c228cb93ab, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Find one of the places a stone remembers, so that it knows you, then lay your hand on it. The first will answer to my fire alone. The rest want a Pact Rune, the pact's own mark, scattered through the woods since it broke.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c7db13fb84162940b5427d1eca5b0c8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>First the way home. Then their names. Then there is no one left to find.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb02ba9be387bf642949bf2227fd3c38, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Go, little one. She is just beyond me, off the path. Come back through one of my doors before I close. What you wear I can always bring home. What you carry I cannot.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae0bad5cc79769544bdfec39591871a8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>Good. Not all of them, and not all at once: only what you can hold.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 92eb088c9c0827641af56ec4ab05e3aa, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Hold a ring of them round me, little one, and the forest will remember us for good.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01fa7f3f791ad7648b627d11b3e8c782, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>I am a door, little one, and I have gone to sleep. I am too thin to wake myself. Long ago people kept a hearth beside these stones, and I kept the night from their door. That was the pact. No fire has burned here in a hundred winters.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e876171ee9e610f46a9fbb62bc2bfdaa, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>I felt that. Out past the meadows, a stone remembers me again.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 027a97078d8c401408af36f08edc5178, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>I have not told you everything. The Heartroot was no monster. It was the forest''s guardian: its half of the pact. Your kind let the hearth beside me go cold a hundred winters ago. It kept its half for ninety winters after that, alone, until the hunger got into its roots.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3fd5cc9260f173e4584b73dc9293c118, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>I listen for your people every night. Some nights I hear them.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 28994191dbd3af94f8f15c29e4cb191b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>I remember this. A fire beside my stones, and someone to keep it.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 70aaab431ff8bcb45aa064a14f628865, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>It broke against you. It will try again, somewhere else. Let it find you ready.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85b859ca10cf7e440a7441d7e25611c7, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>It is all one thing, little one. Something old is pushing those roots, from somewhere deep in the woods. When the woods tell me where, I will tell you.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 20183a6ba2a5c2d448b6a84741a03f1b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>It will. The pact gave the forest its room as well, and that is the one thing it has not forgotten. It will push against every stone you light. Hold what you take, and in time it leaves it be.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc15045b39c8f71439b2236e255c0c0c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Its last word was for you. Hearth-keeper. Nobody has called anyone that in a hundred winters, and I did not teach it to you. One day you will tell me why these stones woke for your hand.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 099669a60861b47458c1d3c6209f2a32, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Listen, little one. Rest your hand on the stone.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47f021c2af1bec44fbd0f1cfc03ecdaa, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Listen. A hammer, far off in the deep woods, slow and uneven. One of yours. Ask me what the woods hold before you go, and I will tell you where.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: feb837e2b9c472a4d8626a71c0b2f091, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>Listen. Far off, at dusk, a horn: three long notes and a rest, over and over. The expedition''s signal. Someone out there has seen your light and is answering it.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf7aad7fc17f7d441bb210eac14b2e4c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Little one, behind you! My ward is too thin yet. They are coming up through it.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 65c84ba33797e2248b2d9ed85fa509ba, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Little one, do you feel it? The forest is gathering against one of your stones. It means to push in.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: db12e2254d15d1540b7abc70fcd9654c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>Little one. Three times through me, and three times home. Your fire reaches further than it did. Come and sit by me when you can: there is something out past my meadows you should know of.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a7d55eb974874e44b00453e913d14a3, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Look, now that there is light to see by. Three of my stones, choked in roots. And the roots are moving, little one. Slowly. Towards me.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bb62719f007704640b29f67420bcfe93, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Marks on the trees that only the dark shows. Go through at night.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6329a2be4ad8eed48a418423664d3240, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>My stones have gone quiet, but she is right. One spark burns close, just beyond me, hiding from the wolves. Make yourself tools, and go.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bfbe03507f7aeef43886c2ab5bb32825, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>My ward keeps out the worst of the forest, not all of it. Put a wall between your fire and the trees.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae64ba3b9fa96564296c2d643e889132, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Now bring me what you freed. Feed me that light and I will open for you, as I did in the dark.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d56983cd10ed7a6428a760b7cf596c1c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Now feed yourself. Berries, water from the stream, a stew over your fire. You will be walking people home.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 877935895dc76eb48b1120c4ead9f018, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Now it must be held, little one. A lit stone is a promise, and the forest will test it.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7feb3fea0f1e4244abf6a2b425ef60fe, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>Now the woods have told me. Something breathes under the roots, little one, in a hollow deep in the Misty Woods: a guardian, as old as my stones. It will not wake for steel. Take an ember from your own fire to it. That, it cannot ignore.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 98db259428deace43880f12a215bb382, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Old stones are humming in the deep woods. Someone is inside the ring, writing.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ddb3e92b41d99d043994c3a303242256, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>One fire brought Ingrid home. The others will want more than a fire: a bench, a furnace, a dry place to set down what they carry. Build what they will need.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21e8cdb925678224a8f1046b169be691, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>One weapon is one answer, and it will not last for ever. Make a second at your workshop: a club stuns what a blade only cuts.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a679f47d0d179e47b828af65dcf0861, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Rootlings, in my clearing. Feed me those orbs, and they will not get in so easily again.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c7373c4ea4249d049a2aef50bbac72c9, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Secure. Feel how still it is out there now. A land held that firmly sends home what it grows at every dawn, and the night's bands will not come through it.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a1f4e13859738843936e8b84c37d7f0, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Seven sparks, scattered through the Misty Woods. They are alive. I hear them when the wind is right. But the forest does not kill the lost, little one. It forgets them.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06112ce3b2b803847aa8b156a6f98efc, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>She is close, little one. Just beyond me, off the path, hiding. Find her, keep her near you, and bring her through.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46887ac32c53b0345bdcaea3106e1dd0, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Smoke from a farmstead that burned long ago. Someone kept the seed.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c488a7f1beb348489f7da2956d9d3ee, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>So light one. The forest cannot forget a hearth that someone tends. It will feed my ward, and out in the mist your people will see it and know which way is home.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 78ffc9810abe0fa47881e46768436703, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Someone is cooking out there. The wolves can smell it. So can I.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: af8543cfb04620148a31d97d340309e9, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Something tests my ward. Out there, someone else is holding a clearing against the wolves. Bring him to hold mine.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86e4d95f0e519d84ab5886faa3602f86, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>That is what you killed. I am sorry. Someone had to.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d446fac584bfe740aeb4399331d5c98, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>The brighter this place burns, the further it can be seen. Build. Clear the old growth. Give them something worth walking towards.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1e05aa8507ec6e4496f18c6ccac3643, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>The forest cannot forget a place that someone tends.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2724747ca5f838a4098d1f3e3c7544b8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>The forest has put its roots in even here. Three stones around the clearing still hold my light, choked and cold. Free them, and bring the Life Orbs back.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e55fd80a005fbb4b83707ecf565a258, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>The forest is gathering against your stone, little one. Stand watch beside it, or burn the rot's heart on a raid. It will not wait for you.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc243190a3b795f4fad6dd30a0224c33, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>The last of an old promise. I keep the dark from this clearing. But that is not what you need to know.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 495056b8518576c46bc75fc2e6d14fd8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>The light that reached her reached other things as well. They are on the old path now, testing me. Prepare yourself. When you are ready, tell me, and I will let them come.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e29c3bcb4b9dee646bdab9d4eee22e01, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>The stones are still out there. They only want a hand that keeps a fire.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9e8868ab91a7f9a488bb0eaff7fd9825, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Then she is still herself, and she is holding on. She will want the others home before her. Bring them, little one, and keep this fire high.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: edfaddb961b50a64b817d20fed6eff4a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>There. A hearth beside my stones, after a hundred winters.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 92501bcf7ce226941abbadd2eba70c0d, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>What you carry through me, the woods can take from you. What you leave here, I keep. Build a chest beside your workshop (G), and put in it what you cannot bear to lose.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 67dfff8ced5006a47ac8e185cb37edbf, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>When the hearth went cold, the stones went cold, one by one. The forest took back what they held, and every road and every name in it. That is where your people are now: out in the land that forgot us.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bbac38121da755f41a937d1b5faad2d4, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>When the pact was kept, your people did not only tend a hearth beside me. They walked the land the pact gave them, and where it ended they set stones, and lit them from this fire.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f5d6049f1881f54282f78fb229824e3, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>With its roots gone quiet I can reach further. North, past the troll country, the road is open. The old one that broke my stones the night you fell walks that road. It came for the door then. Go carefully.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e877300c3b743f4b80579f413f7d503, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>With what? You have nothing but your hands, and I cannot open.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08ad8f258c3cd6c4e991b543e09aecf7, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Would you have woken it, knowing? It could not be saved, only stopped. Better by the hand of someone who keeps a hearth.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8815cd1550a606419bb597f2f0190a0, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>You brought it down. Lay what you carried out of the hollow by the fire, little one, where it can feel the warmth. It is owed that much.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3edca4d7723e4f943b009bce0bf73f03, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>You brought the woods home on your back. Now make something of them: a lodge by the trees, a saw that turns logs into planks. The smithy and the walls start with a plank.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f44e9644898c76746a77e9e003a9ad44, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>You came for coin. There is none here. Stay anyway. They need you to.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 97bed2bd255ce06429306d728c819b38, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>You came for coin. There is none in this. But there is a debt now, and you have begun to pay it.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae145b9e211476d479631238064a59a0, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>You came for someone. Every one of your people is out there because of what was let go cold. Bring them home, and the debt grows smaller.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d85174a3bbba2be49856c90b52a3ad2e, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>You came looking for someone. Now there are others looking for you. Let them find a light.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd3d0786a14d3114290a9cc050c68f54, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>You came to see if the stories were true. Here is the one nobody tells: we broke the pact first.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ad95d5e6432ac6f40b6a333fe91d4c89, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>You came to see whether the stories were true. Now you are one of them.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ed23c52d4c657448b67201578f40c43, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>You have a fire. Now a roof to work under: a workshop beside it (G). What the woods break, it mends.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 64b42d68b6d472e45991c36cbef2ac45, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: '<i>Your fire reaches further than it did, little one. Far enough that I can feel what lies at the end of it: stones, cold ones, out past the meadows.</i>'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93feb0e7bbdb87e47a331f9f92e66887, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: <i>Your people did, long before you were born. You are mending it. Every fire kept here is a payment on that debt.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d2be176329f44fd429ca06b72bf413a9, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: Warmth stirs in the old stone. <i>Little one. You fell out of the dark with the whole forest at your heels, and I caught you. I could only catch one.</i>
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e908dad5b84b034aa1c89605501007c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: The Portal
    text: Warmth stirs in the old stone. Little one. You fell out of the dark with the whole forest at your heels, and I caught you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c0bc10ad127760f41bf8def281d20d27, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Anything else?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72de23cfcb9ce3748950e6605d30ee71, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Behind you!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3478392cee0a6d14992642883bd551f4, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Clear. Get your breath.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5abd2dbe85687042bce5933f7ede5b0, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Here they come!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f8dda0024bd76d4abef90807961c006, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Hold still. Drink this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1acdeaf5a285de54c9e330164cec11cd, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Tor
    text: I can't take much more of this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f549b64f04cb11e4491106b4c978587c, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Tor
    text: I owe you one.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 65f8a5079f5fb6e4abae06a42de6eccd, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Tor
    text: I'll hold this spot.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 356a6042acc62a0488f6fc3168bfe2b8, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: I'll keep back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a01f0faea2195234c8e3a55c27794e63, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: I'm hurt!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 71215f8855ab31349b81bf3629b8c9a9, type: 3}
    mood: Scared
  - speaker: Tor
    text: It's built crooked, you know. All of it. Give me a week.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8abd1003293a6e438363cd6f965c716, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: My tools. Leave them, if you have to. Not me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d11f53227e8ff3438c116d8c7325b3b, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Not yet, you don't. Drink.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8363a6865595cc140a1936731f2cc580, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Nothing gets to you without going through me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13fc2e541f24dfc4a9cd7610788aaba6, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Point the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 974f9a5a16ed6c5448d0d7bc8ff8965a, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Right behind you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2199a36fa6935c540ba9bca7eb68a5d0, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Stay near the stones. We can still get out of this together.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80a7b10dbb46b504b84b348e936ad626, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Still here. Still here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f66df6fc0122180468afea4c78b3f6fb, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Still measuring. I knew someone would come, and I wanted something to show for it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54de7c6e93532c442afb2be3d1d7622e, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Thank you. I thought that was it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 45f142b969a14484680a2b44d41578eb, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Tor
    text: That's the last of them.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c53519ad0e473d48aef5e3d7de9e3fe, type: 3}
    mood: Glad
  - speaker: Tor
    text: There's a hollow in the deep woods where nothing grows, and the ground breathes there. In, out, slow as a sleeper. I lay three nights on this leg listening to it. Whatever is down there is old, and it's what moves the roots. Now, where do you want your planks?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: addf2974c5abbb54887c1330fe8f5bb9, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: This stone is dry enough. Give me sound timber and a little daylight, and I could make somewhere worth staying. For now, this fire will do.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc7da1ac72a2c39449bb2ed986e0a51b, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Watch your back!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e8baa4b66a79e74f9bd421e8ec9575f, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Tor
    text: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1145757ac511ea841b0db4a8e688832e, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Tor
    text: Weapons up!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3718585d9624f4a4ba0ef1ccc6917507, type: 3}
    mood: Yelling
  - speaker: Tor
    text: You're bleeding. Here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b74aa70dfba66846a6ac1995b438a59, type: 3}
    mood: Stern
  - speaker: Yrsa
    text: I can't go on... come back for me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1668b27669fa1bc4496e28a274da3c97, type: 3}
    mood: Tired
  - speaker: Yrsa
    text: Mind the pot. If you've come to eat, you'll carry.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd99dc6c12df6d848ad56f20cd74c4ab, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  - speaker: Yrsa
    text: Show me your kitchen. No, on second thought, show me what you eat.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0522fb080b1400041956fcad741b057c, type: 3}
    mood: Neutral
  handPlaced: []
  subtitleTail: 0.6
